WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.780 --> 00:00:03.260
How has fan support been?

2
00:00:03.260 --> 00:00:06.180
Has it been pretty steady or . . .

3
00:00:06.180 --> 00:00:07.360
Yeah.

4
00:00:07.360 --> 00:00:10.780
You know, we’ve always had great fan support here.

5
00:00:10.780 --> 00:00:16.620
Football and sports have been, you know, a great integral in the university.

6
00:00:16.620 --> 00:00:21.700
And in all forms of athletics, we’ve had wonderful fan support.

7
00:00:21.700 --> 00:00:27.020
For instance, Scott, Saturday we played the University of Alabama here on national TV.

8
00:00:27.020 --> 00:00:33.720
And, you know, we’ve won one game and lost seven and you’d think that the stands would be empty.

9
00:00:33.720 --> 00:00:39.380
Well, heck, we had seventy, seventy-two or seventy-four thousand fans in the stands I think.

10
00:00:39.380 --> 00:00:41.980
So the fan support has always been excellent.
